  <RM_FireFrontLetterText>A line of ember-grass has caught somewhere out in the open, and it is walking.\n\nThis is the biome, not an attack. It happens every few days here and it is why the Tribes plant firebreaks instead of fences. Decide now whether it comes anywhere near you — a burn-line is far cheaper to steer than to stop.</RM_FireFrontLetterText>

